\section{Overview}

The cosimulation harness runs two [[BerzerkMachine]] implementations
side by side, feeding identical input sequences, and comparing outputs
at two levels:

\begin{itemize}
\item \textbf{Subroutine level:} For each matched subroutine invocation,
  compare the unordered set of side effects.
\item \textbf{Frame level:} Compare VRAM content at each frame boundary.
\end{itemize}

The harness also supports input recording and playback for deterministic
replay, and trace capture for bidirectional debugging.

